# Gastal Blockbuster: "When this creature enters, you may sacrifice a creature or Vehicle. When you do, destroy target artifact an opponent
# controls." (CR 701.21a, 603.12). Turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices Memnite (an artifact creature: it is offered as a creature); Mox Jet (a
# noncreature artifact) is not a legal sacrifice. The reflexive trigger's target must be an artifact Bot2 controls: Bot1's own Mox Ruby and
# Bot2's Savannah Lions (a nonartifact creature) are refused, Bot2's Mox Jet is destroyed and Bot2's Mox Pearl is left alone. Sacrificing two (Memnite and Gastal itself) is refused: "a creature or Vehicle" is one.

